{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "b60072db-a16e-45f5-9425-bb80f5f9122c"/*RenderScene*/,
  "Description": "Renders a shaded scene into an image that also carries its depth, normals, velocity and camera.\n\nConnect the scene (a [Camera] with draw operators) to Command. The Output is a normal image that every image operator accepts. Post effects that understand render bundles, like [ScreenSpaceLighting] and [TXAA], take depth, normals, velocity and the camera from it, so one connection is enough; an explicitly connected buffer input still wins. The output window shows the bundle after the format, e.g. 1920x1080 RGBA16F +DNV.\n\nThe separate buffer outputs are there for operators that need them connected explicitly.\n\nAKA: render, scene, gbuffer\n\nSee also: [RenderTarget], [ScreenSpaceLighting], [TXAA]",
  "SymbolTags": "1",
  "InputUis": [
    {
      "InputId": "1b69a1ec-5f03-4182-b002-21c6387a68cf"/*Command*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": -283.33188
      },
      "Description": "The scene to render, usually a [Camera] with draw operators."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "3db94583-6694-47e5-b775-23eb351e9f11"/*ClearColor*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -140.0,
        "Y": 70.0
      }
    },
    {
      "InputId": "5b838d3a-b693-4524-b8cd-b60530173d46"/*Resolution*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -140.0,
        "Y": 35.0
      },
      "Description": "Size in pixels. 0×0 uses the requested resolution, e.g. the output window's."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "679fa6c5-7b78-4846-b462-4de672cd63b0"/*Multisampling*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -140.0,
        "Y": 105.0
      },
      "Description": "Samples per pixel (1, 2, 4 or 8). 1 is usually right when [TXAA] smooths the edges; multisampling averages normals and velocity at edges.",
      "Min": 1,
      "Max": 8,
      "ClampMin": true,
      "ClampMax": true
    },
    {
      "InputId": "bcb6064d-e137-4cd7-b743-cc84058a0d23"/*WithMaterialBuffer*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": 0.0
      },
      "Description": "Also renders base color and material buffers, which post effects like [ScreenSpaceReflections] use for rough and metallic surfaces. Off by default to save memory."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "e67e7052-1f2f-4ad0-909f-f97190128c34"/*Environment*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -280.0,
        "Y": -108.33188
      }
    }
  ],
